  "math_index": [
    {
      "text": "high-confidence (> 0.5) phrase-box pseudo annotations,",
      "section_id": "sec:data",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "L = Lcls + Lloc.",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "O=EncI(Img), Scls =OW T , Lcls =loss(Scls; T).",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Here3, O ∈RN×d are the object/region/box features of the",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "input image, W ∈Rc×d is the weight matrix of the box",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "classifier C, Scls ∈RN×c are the output classification log-",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "its, T ∈{0, 1}N×c is the target matching between regions",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Prompt = “Detect: person, bicycle, car, ... , toothbrush”,",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "O=EncI(Img), P =EncL(Prompt), Sground =OP ⊤, (3)",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "where P ∈RM×d is the contextual word/token features",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "RN×M and the target T ∈{0, 1}N×c. The number of (sub)-",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "5), we expand the original target matrix T ∈{0, 1}N×c to",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "T ′ ∈{0, 1}N×M by making all sub-words positive match",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "P ∈Rc×d, if written in the form of (3). Recently, phrase",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "i2t = X-MHA(Oi, P i),",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "i ∈{0, 1, .., L −1}",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Oi+1 = DyHeadModule(Oi+Oi",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "O = OL,",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "P i+1 = BERTLayer(P i+P i",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "P = P L,",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "O(q) =OW (q,I), P (q) =PW (q,L), Attn=O(q)(P (q))⊤/",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "P (v) = PW (v,L), Ot2i = SoftMax(Attn)P (v)W (out,I),",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "O(v) = OW (v,I), Pi2t = SoftMax(Attn⊤)O(v)W (out,L),",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "where {W (symbol,I), W (symbol,L) : symbol ∈{q, v, out}}",
      "section_id": "sec:related-work",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 5
    }
